TEXT -208 400 Left 2 ;This line is very long (1000kM)\nstalu_u1150_o6x680mm2\nThe transformers are modelled as ideal\ntransformer without lost and inner resistance\nThe line is partitioned in 10 sublines\na 100kM. Because of the high cap. load of\nthe lines shunt reactors are added.
