TEXT -208 -216 Left 4 ;This example shows two generators which\nare seperated by a line with 1000km length\nGen1 is controlled by a PI-controller for the\nspeed. Magn. voltage is fixed by 600V\nThe frequency of gen1 starts with 1500/30=50Hz and is\nincreased after 5s till 25.5s to 1510/30=50.33Hz\nYou can see that the uncontrolled right generator2\nfollows the frequency of generator1
TEXT 72 408 Left 2 ;HINT: for checking the active power of the elements\nALT+Click on the elements.\nThe lines loss is about 0.1MW per line element\nThe loss of the shunt reactor of the line is about\n0.750MW per reactor\nGenerator1 produces
TEXT -176 -32 Left 2 ;Output starts at >100ms
